      "content": "That's a pretty strong take. But if you look at the strain on public infrastructure, schools, and local social services in border towns and big cities, doesn't a focus on enforcement make more sense to ensure we don't lose control of the system entirely? How do you reconcile the humanitarian benefits you mentioned with the immediate, practical need for national security and orderly processing?",
